# LIFF ID from the LINE Developers Console, under the chatbot's Messaging
# API channel -- add a LIFF app there ("LIFF" tab), Size: Full, Endpoint URL:
# wherever this app is deployed. Format is "{channelId}-{randomId}"; the
# backend derives channel_id from this same value (src/line/liff_tasks.py),
# so it must be the real one, not a placeholder.
VITE_LIFF_ID=

# The chatbot FastAPI backend's base URL (this repo's own src/, deployed
# separately from this app). Must be reachable from inside LINE's in-app
# browser, and its CORS_ORIGINS must include wherever this app is deployed.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
